+# ===========================================================================
+internal/buildsource	TestFrozenTokenRejectsMutation	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	a frozen build source rejects mutation of the source tree
+internal/buildsource	TestFrozenTokenRejectsMutation/*	-	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	a link-dependent subtest may skip where the host forbids symlinks
+internal/buildsource	TestFrozenTokenRejectsRootReplacement	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	a frozen build source rejects replacement of its root
+internal/buildsource	TestWithValidatedOrdersCallbackAndRejectsMutation	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	validated enumeration is ordered and refuses mutation during the callback
+internal/buildsource	TestWithValidatedOrdersCallbackAndRejectsMutation/*	-	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	a link-dependent subtest may skip where the host forbids symlinks
