+internal/godriver	TestProbeSetGuardMatchesTheInventoryExactly	darwin,windows	-	-	the probed native control set matches rc5-native-control-inventory-v1 exactly
+internal/godriver	TestEveryControlSeamFailureRejectsBeforeTheWorkerExecutes	darwin,windows	-	-	every native control seam failure rejects before the worker executes
+internal/godriver	TestPerFileSizeLimitIsReallyApplied	darwin	windows	platform-control	per-file-size-limit is a real kernel limit inherited by the compiler; the inventory defines it for macOS only
+internal/godriver	TestBuildFailsClosedWhenTheGoChildCannotStart	windows	darwin	platform-control	active-process-count-limit refuses the compiler natively; the inventory defines it for Windows only
+
+# ===========================================================================
+# Executable identity and executable behaviour
+# ===========================================================================
+internal/godriver	TestExecutableIdentityRejectsSubstitutionAndMutation	darwin,windows	-	-	the toolchain executable identity rejects substitution and mutation
+internal/runtimestore	TestUnixPostInstallShimPropagatesSignal	linux,darwin	-	-	the installed unix shim is executable and propagates signals
+internal/shell	TestPosixHookEntersNestedSwitchesAndLeavesProjects	linux,darwin	windows	platform-control	executes the POSIX shell hook end to end
+internal/shell	TestPowerShellHookRunsOnEveryPrompt	windows	linux,darwin	platform-control	executes the PowerShell prompt hook end to end
+internal/envfiles	TestWriteProjectShapesAndSourcing	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	sources the generated env file through a real shell on unix; shape-only on Windows
+internal/install	TestEndToEndInstall	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	materialises the executable shim and env files of a full install
+internal/adapters	TestSymlinkModeStagesRelativeLinkTargets	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	creates a link (Windows: a reparse point) and asserts its target stays relative
