+# ===========================================================================
+internal/transaction	TestValidateIndependentTargetNamespacesRejectsOverlappingPaths	linux,darwin,windows	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	independent target namespaces reject overlapping paths (link-capability guarded)
+internal/transaction	TestSaveJournalRejectsNamespaceAliasIntroducedBetweenSaves	linux,darwin,windows	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	a namespace alias introduced between saves is rejected (link-capability guarded)
+internal/transaction	TestRecoverRejectsDecodedTargetNamespacesAliasedWhileStopped	linux,darwin,windows	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	recovery rejects target namespaces aliased while stopped (link-capability guarded)
+internal/install/atomicity	TestFailureAtEveryTargetClassRestoresPriorStateInReverseOrder	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	a failure at every target class restores the prior state in reverse order
+internal/install/atomicity	TestStaleAdapterRemovalRollsBackToTheExactPriorEntry	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	a stale adapter removal rolls back to the exact prior entry
+internal/install/atomicity	TestAdapterMirrorLinksAreJournaledAndRestoredExactly	linux,darwin,windows	linux,darwin,windows	host-capability	adapter mirror links are journaled and restored exactly (link-capability guarded)
+
+# ===========================================================================
+# Interop / conformance consumer
+# ===========================================================================
+internal/interop	TestGoldenContextCopy	linux,darwin,windows	-	-	the agent context copied for a skill matches the authoritative golden file list
+internal/godriver	TestCandidateGoV1SourceAwareContract	darwin,windows	darwin,windows	root-content	the go-v1 driver honours the source-aware contract published by the supplied root
